    "epilog": "\nExamples:\n  # View DEF info\n  python main.py info creature.def\n\n  # Unpack (VCMI PNG mode - default)\n  python main.py unpack creature.def --mode=png\n  # Output: meta.json + 0_001.png + 0_002.png + ...\n\n  # Unpack (BMP mode)\n  python main.py unpack creature.def --mode=bmp\n\n  # Unpack (PNG mode + keep .pixels.dat for debugging)\n  python main.py unpack creature.def --mode=png --keep-pixels\n\n  # Recursively unpack entire Mod directory (serial)\n  python main.py unpack Mods/ --recursive --mode=png\n\n  # Recursively unpack entire Mod directory (parallel, 4 threads)\n  python main.py unpack Mods/ --recursive --parallel --mode=png\n\n  # Recursive unpack (parallel, 8 threads)\n  python main.py unpack Mods/ --recursive --parallel --max-workers=8\n\n  # Repack (auto-detect format)\n  python main.py repack creature/\n  python main.py repack creature.def_unpacked\n\n  # Repack (specify mode, enable dithering)\n  python main.py repack creature/ --mode=png --dither\n\n  # Recursive repack (serial)\n  python main.py repack Mods/ --recursive\n\n  # Recursive repack (parallel, 4 threads)\n  python main.py repack Mods/ --recursive --parallel\n\n  # Recursive repack (parallel, 8 threads + dithering)\n  python main.py repack Mods/ --recursive --parallel --max-workers=8 --dither\n\n  # Clean unpacked directories\n  python main.py clean-unpack Mods/ --dry-run\n\n  # Clean .def files with unpacked directories\n  python main.py clean-def Mods/ --dry-run\n\n  # Validate round-trip (unpack -> repack -> unpack -> pixel comparison)\n  python main.py valid creature.def --mode=png\n  python main.py valid creature.def --mode=bmp\n\n  # Batch test (recursive / sample / parallel)\n  python main.py test Mods/ --recursive --mode=png\n  python main.py test Mods/ --recursive --sample=5 --seed=42\n  python main.py test Mods/ --recursive --parallel --mode=png",
